></i></span></span>"}]}],"nl":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Dutch","definitions":[{"definition":"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fun\" title=\"fun\">fun</a>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Wij hebben veel <b>lol</b>.","translation":"We are having a lot of fun."},{"example":"Wat een <b>lol<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">!</span></b>","translation":"What a laugh!"}],"examples":["Wij hebben veel <b>lol</b>.","Wat een <b>lol<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">!</span></b>"]}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Interjection","language":"Dutch","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt53\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/LOL\" title=\"LOL\">LOL</a> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt54\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\" about=\"#mwt54\">\"laughing out loud\", expression of mirth</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt54\">)</span>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Hij heeft niet eens een fiets <b>lol</b>","translation":"He doesn't even have a bicycle, <b>LOL</b>"}],"examples":["Hij heeft niet eens een fiets <b>lol</b>"]}]}],"fr":[{"partOfSpeech":"Interjection","language":"French","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt65\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/LOL\" title=\"LOL\">LOL</a>"}]}],"other":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Maia","definitions":[{"definition":"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/sand\" title=\"sand\">sand</a>"},{"definition":"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/beach\" title=\"beach\">beach</a>"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"Mokilese","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt73\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/wet\" title=\"wet\">wet</a>"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Mokilese","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"new\">salmon herring</span>"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun